# Batch [B] part 1 (0.4.4): from fm1-build-status.md. Jersey club's last three kicks bounce as 8th-note triplets
# (SFX_TRIP in gen.c); Gqom has no kick on 1 and no hats.

style BALLROOM
kick     X... .... X... ....
clap     .... X... .... X...
chat     o.o. o.o. o.o. o.o.
cymbal   ..x. .... ..x. .x..

style JERSEY
kick     X... ..X. ..X. X.x.
clap     .... X... .... X...
rim      .x.. ...x .x.. ..x.
chat     x.x. x.x. x.x. x.x.

style GQOM
kick     ..x. .... ..x. .x..
rim      .... x... .... x...
tom      x... ..x. .... x...
conga    .x.x ...x .x.. ..x.

style KUDURO
kick     X... X... X... X..x
clap     .... X... .... X...
tom      ..xx .x.x ..xx .xx.
cowbell  ..x. ..x. ..x. ..xx
